<title>UK: Spintab sets 500 million mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Spintab sets 500 million mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Bayerische Landesbank and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SPINTAB</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    21.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE    21.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.5	 REOFFER    99.75     SPREAD	+35 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OBL 122 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
